{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "12158231-0e8e-8e2c-8d9f-222f4258c060",
  "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:00:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Susan Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:56:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:57:04-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, sorry, I'm going to be quiet. I'm at work and the kids are napping. I'm an aide at a daycare, so I've got about forty minutes of peace."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:57:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Whisper away. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:57:24-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I paid the first installment of the property tax. Well, my landlord's bill, but I pay it through him and he told me to check. Um, I just want to confirm it posted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:57:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you have the address or the bill number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:57:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sixty-two Bliss Road. Down by Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:57:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sixty-two Bliss Road. Give me a second, let me pull it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:57:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. [pause] I mean, it's been two weeks. It came out of the account already, so it should be there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:58:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I see it. First installment posted last week, on the Thursday. Shows as paid in full for that quarter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:58:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. Then why did he get a notice? He said something came in the mail saying it was still due."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:58:30-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be the notice went out before the payment cleared. Those get printed on a schedule and they don't check for payments that landed that week. If it's dated before last Thursday, you can toss it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:58:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, so I drove across town on my lunch for nothing. Wonderful."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:58:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you did get a nice drive out of it. Anyway, you're all set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:59:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm. Okay. [pause] Hold on, sorry. Somebody's rolling over. [pause] Okay. Fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:59:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:59:13-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. What are the assessor's office hours? He wants me to ask about the, um, the valuation thing on the notice, and I'd rather not call back again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:59:27-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Assessor's office is in City Hall, open weekdays, morning through the afternoon, closing around four thirty. If you go in person, I'd say get there before three to be safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:59:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Before three. Okay. And is that a different line from this one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:59:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Different office, so yes. I can transfer you right now if you want. They're open this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T09:59:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I can't talk that long. One of them just woke up, I think. I'll try later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T10:00:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. If you do call, just ask for the assessor's office at the main line and they'll route you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T10:00:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the payment posted, the notice is a mistake, and the assessor is open till four thirty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T10:00:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. You could write it on your hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T10:00:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Funny. Okay, thanks. I've got to go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T10:00:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good luck with the nap brigade. Bye now."
    }
  ],
